Subject: shared utilities the app imports through the kit

What: src/utils (binary, encode, path, record, report-error, select-item, text),
createSimpleContext's `useOptional` and structural `ready` read, the i18n fallback
typed without casts, and useFilteredList's string search and Enter fallback.
Why: the app reaches these through `@opencode-ai/ui/utils/*`, `context` and `hooks`.
useFilteredList: `initialActive` is captured while the list is still empty, so Enter
pressed before the async filter settled selected nothing; it now falls back to the
first row, as `reset` does.

